    "title": "More Arizona counties are reporting measles cases as outbreak continues - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KJZZ ,\n1 days ago Arizona has confirmed 228 measles cases since August, most of which have been in a remote area of Mohave County. But in the past three weeks, Coconino, Pima, Maricopa and Pinal counties have all reported their first cases. Maricopa and Pima county health officials are warning of potential public measles... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 13",
